{
  "version": 1,
  "project": {
    "title": "Sotto Language Launch",
    "description": "Cinematic product launch video for Sotto, open-source self-hostable language-learning infrastructure"
  },
  "defaults": {
    "ttsProvider": "elevenlabs",
    "ttsModel": "eleven_v3",
    "ttsVoiceId": "VOICEID_PLACEHOLDER",
    "backgroundMusicVolume": 0.07,
    "subtitles": {
      "enabled": true,
      "style": "cinematic",
      "position": "bottom",
      "fontSize": 34
    }
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "title": "Landing Page: Brand Introduction",
      "narration": "Learn a language, taught in your own context. Sotto is open-source, self-hostable language learning. You connect your own Claude or Codex and your own keys, then progress through mastery-gated courses on a stack you fully control.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 300, "duration": 2000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 2000 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 400, "duration": 2000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 2000 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": -700, "duration": 1500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": false,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Learn a language, taught in your own context.",
          "position": "center",
          "showAtSeconds": 0.5,
          "hideAtSeconds": 4,
          "fontSize": 40,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "fade" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Choose Your Language",
      "narration": "Start by choosing what you want to learn. Here we pick German, taught from English. Your native language is first class, so every explanation meets you where you are.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example/welcome" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='pair'], [class*='language']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='pair']:first-child, [class*='languageCard']:first-child" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "German, from English",
          "position": "top-center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 4,
          "fontSize": 34,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "fade" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Placement Test",
      "narration": "Sotto places you at the right level. A short adaptive test across grammar, reading, and listening finds your CEFR band, so you never repeat what you already know or drown in what you do not.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example/learn/placement" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='question'], [class*='option']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='option']:nth-child(2)" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "button:has-text('Next'), [class*='nextButton']" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='option']:nth-child(1)" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Placed at the right CEFR level",
          "position": "top-center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 4,
          "fontSize": 32,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "dissolve" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Your Course Path",
      "narration": "This is your course. Classes are laid out as a path, each one a focused unit of grammar, reading, listening, and speaking. You advance by showing mastery, not by clicking through.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example/learn" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='classCard'], [class*='path']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 300, "duration": 1800 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "[class*='classCard']:first-child" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": -300, "duration": 1200 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": false,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Mastery-gated CEFR path",
          "position": "top-center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 4,
          "fontSize": 34,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "fade" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Grammar Section",
      "narration": "Open a class and the first section is grammar. You answer in context, with explanations drawn from the same examples you just read. Get one wrong, and the section comes back in a new form until it sticks.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example/learn/class/CLASS_ID_PLACEHOLDER" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='section'], [class*='question']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='option']:nth-child(2)" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 250, "duration": 1200 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "transition": { "type": "dissolve" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Reading Section",
      "narration": "Reading comes next. A short passage at your level, then comprehension questions that check understanding, not guesswork. New words you meet here flow into your memory automatically.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 300, "duration": 1800 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='option']:nth-child(1)" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 250, "duration": 1200 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "transition": { "type": "dissolve" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Adaptive Listening: Natural Voices",
      "narration": "Listening is where Sotto comes alive. The same audio engine that powers the platform generates a lesson tuned to the words you are still learning, spoken by natural voices in your target language.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 300, "duration": 1500 },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='player'], [class*='playButton']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1000 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='playButton']" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 8000 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='playButton']" }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "providerBanner": {
        "provider": "ElevenLabs",
        "showAtSeconds": 2,
        "hideAtSeconds": null,
        "position": "bottom-right"
      },
      "ttsProvider": "elevenlabs",
      "ttsModel": "eleven_v3",
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Adaptive listening, built from your due words",
          "position": "top-center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 5,
          "fontSize": 32,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "fade" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Listening: Ask and Choose a Voice",
      "narration": "Stuck on a phrase? Pause and ask, and you get a spoken clarification right away. Every voice and provider is yours to choose. Here is Cartesia, warm and low latency.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 500 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='voiceOption']:nth-child(2), [class*='pill']:nth-child(2)" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1000 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='playButton']" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 7000 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='playButton']" }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "providerBanner": {
        "provider": "Cartesia Sonic",
        "showAtSeconds": 0,
        "hideAtSeconds": null,
        "position": "bottom-right"
      },
      "ttsProvider": "cartesia",
      "ttsModel": "sonic-3",
      "transition": { "type": "dissolve" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Speaking: Pronunciation Feedback",
      "narration": "Then you speak. Record a phrase and Sotto scores your pronunciation word by word, with a transcript and feedback you can act on. An optional avatar tutor models the phrase first.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 350, "duration": 1500 },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='record'], [class*='speaking']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='recordButton'], button:has-text('Record')" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 3500 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[class*='stopButton'], button:has-text('Stop')" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='score'], [class*='feedback']", "timeout": 15000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 2500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "avatar": {
        "posX": 0.72,
        "posY": 0.05,
        "width": 0.25,
        "height": 0.35,
        "maskShape": "rounded",
        "showAtSeconds": 2,
        "hideAtSeconds": null
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Pronunciation feedback, word by word",
          "position": "top-center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 5,
          "fontSize": 32,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "dissolve" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Writing: Inline Corrections",
      "narration": "Writing closes the loop. Respond to a prompt at your level and get inline corrections that show what changed and why, so the next sentence is stronger than the last.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 350, "duration": 1500 },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='writing'], textarea", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1000 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "textarea, [class*='writingInput']" },
        { "type": "type", "selector": "textarea, [class*='writingInput']", "text": "Ich gehe heute in die Stadt, um ein Buch zu kaufen.", "speed": { "min": 30, "max": 70 } },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 600 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "button:has-text('Submit'), [class*='submitButton']" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='correction'], [class*='feedback']", "timeout": 15000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 2500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": true
      },
      "transition": { "type": "dissolve" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Mastery Gate: Pass to Advance",
      "narration": "Finish all four skills and submit. Pass, and the next class unlocks. Fall short on a section, and only that section comes back, in a new form. Progress is earned.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 800 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "button:has-text('Submit class'), [class*='submitClass']" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='passed'], [class*='result']", "timeout": 15000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 2500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": true,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Pass to advance",
          "position": "center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 4,
          "fontSize": 40,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.55)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "fade" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Memory Graph",
      "narration": "Everything you learn lives in a memory graph you own. Vocabulary and grammar become connected nodes, scheduled for review the moment they are about to fade, and woven back into your next listening lesson.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example/memory" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='graph'], canvas", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "zoom", "selector": "[class*='graph'], canvas", "scale": 1.4, "duration": 1200 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 2000 },
        { "type": "zoomReset", "duration": 800 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "[class*='node']:first-child" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": false,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Your memory graph, with spaced review",
          "position": "top-center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 5,
          "fontSize": 32,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "dissolve" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Bring Your Own Agent: Self-Host",
      "narration": "All of it runs on your terms. Connect your own Claude or Codex and your own provider keys, choose what the agent may read, and self-host the whole stack. Your keys, your data, your infrastructure.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example/settings/api" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='keyRow'], [class*='provider']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "scroll", "distance": 250, "duration": 1500 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "[class*='keyRow']:first-child, [class*='provider']:first-child" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": false,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Self-hosted. Your agent, your keys, your data.",
          "position": "top-center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1,
          "hideAtSeconds": 5,
          "fontSize": 32,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "fade" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Closing: Back to Landing",
      "narration": "Sotto. Learn a language, taught in your own context. Place. Practice. Progress.",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "https://your-domain.example" },
        { "type": "waitForSelector", "selector": "[class*='hero']", "timeout": 5000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 4000 }
      ],
      "sfx": {
        "clickSounds": false,
        "typingSounds": false
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "text": "Place. Practice. Progress.",
          "position": "center",
          "showAtSeconds": 1.5,
          "hideAtSeconds": 5,
          "fontSize": 44,
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.5)",
          "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      ],
      "transition": { "type": "fade" }
    }
  ]
}
